        <p>makes no bid for patronage by sharpness or diplo- macy, even in Piano selling. Plain, clean, honest methods are what the public " tie to," and these you always find here. To be spoken of as a house where everybody is dealt with in absolute fairness —to serve you faithfully—to please you always— these are our ambitions. THERE'S ONLY ONE PIANO-SMITTI IN MANCHESTER. Send to SMITH for CATALOGUE, Post Free. PRICES AND TRIMS WILL ASTONISH YOU. PIANOS from 10s. 6d. MONTHLY I ORGANS be. 0.1. TILL PAID FOR. j Every Instrument Guaranteed. Delivered free to any part of England or Wares. Return Railway Fare allowed to country customers. Old Instruments taken in exchange YOUR MONEY RETURNED IF INSTRUMENT IS NOT SATISFACTORY. TIMES MAY BE BAD,</p>
