        <p>MY WONDERFUL 2s. 6D. COLLECTIONS, (CARRIAGE GD 2 /MR 13s. FREE). FOR GARDENS OR GREENHOUSE. CATALOGUES FREE. 12 Mixed Hyacinths for pot or beds, 12 Extra line mixed Single Tulips. 12 Narcissus, rheasant Eve,Dutch extra quality; the poet's pure white. crimson Cup, 12 Jonquils, large single, sweet scented, highly prized for the fragrance, 12 Islas, Cape IllwArs ; tire is no flower more beautifu for cutting purposes bomaets ,te ; rich, brilliant colour 12 Anemone Windilower, single mixed, 12 ?retch Ranunculus ; the French are the finest of all Ranunculus flowers ; all colours, 12 Allium Neap, Star of Bethlehem, pure white, 12 Winter Aconites, the earliest of spring flowers, 12 Crocus in extra fine mixture, 12 Irls Ilispania ; most lose,y flowars, known as poor man's orchid, 12 r, cilia Riborica, lovely blue, ales for pots or garden.</p>
