        <p>SEAWEED AS A MEDICINE.</p>
        <p>ITS MARVELLOUS EFFECT LIFON THE STOMACH, LIVER, KIDNEYS AND BOWELS.</p>
        <p>SEAWEED possesses % natural strengthening, betting and purifying power, far greater than other known remedies. This is now conceded by important authori- ties. It was first introduced by Mr Veno, and Venc's Seaweed Tonic is the only nmedy in the world contain- ing seaweed, for that reason Vano's Seaweed Tonic is used ia hospitals and by doctors themselves because of its superior curative properties. Its most brilliant effect is produced in stomach, liver and kidney diseases, and the extraordinary cures it performs, even in the worst cases, is positive proof of its efficacy. It is a god-send to sufferers from indigestion, wind, headache, general weakness, kidney trouble, weak and painful back, tor- pid liver, female troubles, poorness of blood and HABITUAL CONST/PATION. Ask for VENO'S SEAWEED TONIC. PfICO is ii and 2s 9 I at cnerniscs and medi- cine vendors.</p>
